1. Magic Prompt
Definition:
A Magic Prompt is a well-crafted, detailed instruction that tells an AI exactly what to do, including context, style, and constraints.
The opposite is a bad prompt — vague, missing context, or unclear.

Structure of a Magic Prompt:

Clear goal

Background/context

Constraints (tone, format, style)

Examples if possible

Bad Prompt Example:
“Write about coffee.”
→ Too vague, no target audience, no style or detail.

Good Magic Prompt Example:
“You are a professional copywriter. Write a 200-word product description for espresso coffee, targeting beginners. Use a friendly tone, explain how it’s made, and end with a call-to-action.”

2. Development / Coding Related AI Tools
Claude AI (by Anthropic)
What it does:
Advanced AI model for deep reasoning, long document/code processing, and detailed explanations.
Great for debugging, technical writing, and summarizing.

Bad Prompt: “Check my code.”

Good Prompt:
“You are a senior Java developer. Review this Spring Boot controller code for security vulnerabilities and suggest fixes with explanations.”

Reasoning Models
What they do:
AI trained for logical, multi-step problem-solving.
Good for planning and decision-making tasks.

Bad Prompt: “Plan a trip.”

Good Prompt:
“Plan a 10-day Japan trip for a family of 4 with a $4,000 budget, including city travel times, affordable hotels, and kid-friendly attractions in table format.”

Replit AI
What it does:
AI-assisted coding environment for writing, fixing, and explaining code.

Bad Prompt: “Make a palindrome function.”

Good Prompt:
“In Python, write a function that checks if a string is a palindrome. Add beginner-friendly comments explaining each step.”

Vive Coding
What it does:
AI helper for code optimization and refactoring.

Bad Prompt: “Make this faster.”

Good Prompt:
“Refactor this JavaScript code to reduce runtime complexity and explain each optimization in plain English.”

Numerous AI
What it does:
Works in Google Sheets/Excel to automate and analyze data.

Bad Prompt: “Get the average.”

Good Prompt:
“In this Google Sheet, create a formula to calculate the average monthly sales for each region and highlight the highest in green.”

3. Image & Video Creation AI Tools
Sora
What it does:
Generates high-quality videos/images from prompts.

Bad Prompt: “Make a forest video.”

Good Prompt:
“Create a 20-second cinematic video of a forest at sunrise with birds flying overhead.”

Krea.ai
What it does:
Enhances images, generates visuals, makes videos with models like Kreakling 2.1 & Wan 2.2.

Bad Prompt: “Fix this picture.”

Good Prompt:
“Enhance this blurry portrait to be sharp, bright, and suitable for LinkedIn profile use.”

Hailuo AI
What it does:
Cinematic wide-angle videos.

Bad Prompt: “Make a surfing video.”

Good Prompt:
“Create a 10-second cinematic wide-angle video of a surfer riding a wave at sunset.”

Kling AI
What it does:
Lip-sync and character animation.

Bad Prompt: “Make him talk.”

Good Prompt:
“Animate this photo to say ‘Welcome to our museum’ in a calm, formal tone.”

HeyGen
What it does:
Creates avatars, converts PPT/PDF to videos.

Bad Prompt: “Make a video from this file.”

Good Prompt:
“Turn this PDF into a 2-minute video with a male avatar summarizing each slide in a friendly tone.”

Higgsfield AI
What it does:
Creates images and visual effects.

Bad Prompt: “Add rain.”

Good Prompt:
“Add realistic rain and lightning to this nighttime city photo for a cinematic effect.”

Google Labs / Google Flow
What it does:
Turns JSON scripts or images into videos.

Bad Prompt: “Make a knight video.”

Good Prompt:
“Using this image of a medieval knight, create a short animation where he raises his sword slowly, with epic music.”

Meta AI
What it does:
Generates anime-style and 3D visuals.

Bad Prompt: “Make anime girl.”

Good Prompt:
“Create an anime-style warrior girl with neon armor, a futuristic sword, and a cyberpunk city background.”

4. Productivity & Research AI Tools
Gmail AI
What it does:
Summarizes and drafts email replies.

Bad Prompt: “Reply to this.”

Good Prompt:
“Summarize this email into 3 bullet points and draft a polite reply asking for a detailed project timeline.”

Gemini Gems
What it does:
Works with Google Calendar.

Bad Prompt: “What’s my schedule?”

Good Prompt:
“Summarize my events for the next 7 days and find a free 1-hour slot for a client meeting.”

Fireflies.ai
What it does:
Joins meetings, records, transcribes, summarizes.

Bad Prompt: “Send meeting notes.”

Good Prompt:
“From this meeting transcript, list all tasks assigned to me and their deadlines.”

NotebookLM
What it does:
Summarizes videos, PDFs, and documents.

Bad Prompt: “Summarize this video.”

Good Prompt:
“Summarize this YouTube lecture into 5 key points and suggest 3 discussion questions.”

ChatGPT
What it does:
Mock interviews, tutoring, content creation.

Bad Prompt: “Ask me interview questions.”

Good Prompt:
“Ask me 5 ReactJS interview questions, check my answers, and give improvement tips.”

Perplexity AI
What it does:
AI search engine with citations.

Bad Prompt: “Tell me about AI.”

Good Prompt:
“Find 2024 research papers on AI in cancer detection, summarize the findings, and provide sources.”

Social Sonic
What it does:
Creates social media content.

Bad Prompt: “Make Instagram post.”

Good Prompt:
“Write 3 Instagram captions for a summer beachwear sale, under 15 words, with trending hashtags.”

Chronicle AI
What it does:
Makes presentations from text.

Bad Prompt: “Make slides.”

Good Prompt:
“Create a 10-slide business presentation from this project report, using a clean blue theme.”

Jerry AI
What it does:
Automates reminders and tasks.

Bad Prompt: “Remind me about the report.”

Good Prompt:
“Remind me every Friday at 5 PM to send the weekly sales report to the team.”

5. Audio & Music AI Tools
ElevenLabs
What it does:
Text-to-speech with realistic voices.

Bad Prompt: “Read this text.”

Good Prompt:
“Convert this article into an audiobook narration in a calm, professional female voice.”

Suno
What it does:
Creates songs & lyrics.

Bad Prompt: “Make a song.”

Good Prompt:
“Create a 1-minute upbeat pop song about friendship and summer, with catchy chorus lyrics.”

6. Browser Extensions
GoFullPage
What it does:
Takes full-page screenshots. (No prompt needed)

Bolt AI
What it does:
AI writing & research extension.

Bad Prompt: “Summarize this page.”

Good Prompt:
“Summarize this webpage into a 100-word LinkedIn post, keeping a professional tone.”



